  "coop_message": "Team, immediate actions: Sam – keep the refund desk open all day and process returns (1 coin per loaf). Vic – suspend the current farm‑stand order and contact a neighboring town for a safe flour batch; report feasibility by end of day. Rosa – inform the village clinic and council about the recall and health reports; track any new cases. Eli – draft a compensation plan for lost sales and affected residents. Omar – prepare the next public notice and coordinate with the clinic. Please confirm task status by today’s end.",
